23 0 obj
<< /A 339 0 R /Alt (Architecture diagram of the Automated Kidney Allocation System showing data sources including Hospital Information System, Manual Entry, and HLA Fusion Platform, feeding into an integration layer with Master Patient Index and Donor Data, processed by an Allocation Engine, and output to a Clinical Dashboard. Manual entry and automatic interface pathways are indicated in the legend.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 15 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
24 0 obj
<< /A 340 0 R /Alt (Flowchart illustrating an allocation algorithm and virtual crossmatch decision workflow for transplantation, showing sequential steps: data entry, composite scoring, candidate retrieval, VXM engine, VXM classification \(negative, positive\204amenable DSA, positive\), followed by ranked output and clinical review, with key decision criteria and process notes detailed in labeled boxes.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 16 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
25 0 obj
<< /A 341 0 R /Alt (Six scatter plots compare cPRA percentages and wait time in kidney transplant patients by different factors. Panels A to E show cPRA \(%\) against age group, gender, transplant history, pregnancy history, and transfusion history, while panel F compares wait time \(years\) between HSP and non-HSP groups. Significant p-values indicate statistical differences for all factors except transfusion history.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 19 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
